    "detailed_description": "Join a addictive roguelike game where you constantly recruit human warriors and form powerful combat teams to complete challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen facing waves of enemies such as undead, elf, and orc with increasing strength, purchase appropriate weapons and equipment, select appropriate skills, and form a powerful faction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA series of light and joyful yet passionate battles, leading your warriors to charge happily and enjoy the fun of electronic cricket fighting!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. There are four different game modes, each with its own unique features, providing you with a rich and interesting challenge experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Recruit warriors from different professions and talents, form powerful faction teams, and activate the bond effect.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Select equipment for heroes, activate traits, eat food, and further enhance their abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4. Fight in various environments and against different enemies, carefully select your opponents and defeat them!",
